0e9."],"Font family uninstalled successfully.":["Rodina p\u00edsma bola \u00faspe\u0161ne odin\u0161talovan\u00e1."],"Choose font variants. Keep in mind that too many variants could make your site slower.":["Vyberte si typy p\u00edsma. Majte na pam\u00e4ti, \u017ee pr\u00edli\u0161 ve\u013ea typov p\u00edsma m\u00f4\u017ee spomali\u0165 va\u0161u webov\u00fa str\u00e1nku."],"To install fonts from Google you must give permission to connect directly to Google servers. The fonts you install will be downloaded from Google and stored on your site. Your site will then use these locally-hosted fonts.":["Ak chcete nain\u0161talova\u0165 typy p\u00edsma od spolo\u010dnosti Google, mus\u00edte udeli\u0165 povolenie na priame pripojenie k serverom Google. Typy p\u00edsma, ktor\u00e9 si nain\u0161talujete, sa stiahnu zo slu\u017eby Google a ulo\u017eia sa na va\u0161u str\u00e1nku. Va\u0161a str\u00e1nka potom pou\u017eije tieto lok\u00e1lne hostovan\u00e9 typy p\u00edsma."],"You can alternatively upload files directly on the Upload tab.":["Alternat\u00edvne m\u00f4\u017eete nahra\u0165 s\u00fabory priamo na karte Nahra\u0165."],"Allow access to Google Fonts":["Povoli\u0165 pr\u00edstup ku Google Fonts"],"Select font variants to install.":["Vyberte varianty fontu na in\u0161tal\u00e1ciu."],"Font name\u2026":["N\u00e1zov p\u00edsma..."],"No fonts found. Try with a different search term.":["Nena\u0161li sa \u017eiadne typy p\u00edsma. Sk\u00faste pou\u017ei\u0165 in\u00fd v\u00fdraz."],"Upload font":["Nahra\u0165 p\u00edsmo"],"Library":["Kni\u017enica"],"Install Fonts":["In\u0161talova\u0165 typy p\u00edsma"],"Fonts":["Typy p\u00edsma"],"%d variant":["%d variant","%d varianty","%d variantov"],"There was an error uninstalling the font family.":["Pri odin\u0161talovan\u00ed rodiny p\u00edsma do\u0161lo k chybe."],"Are you sure you want to delete \"%s\" font and all its variants and assets?":["Naozaj chcete odstr\u00e1ni\u0165 typ p\u00edsma \"%s\" a v\u0161etky jeho varianty a zdroje?"],"Connect to Google Fonts":["Pripoji\u0165 ku Google Fonts"],"font categories\u0004All":["V\u0161etky"],"Error installing the fonts, could not be downloaded.":["Pri in\u0161tal\u00e1cii p\u00edsiem sa vyskytla chyba, nepodarilo sa ich stiahnu\u0165."],"Revoke access to Google Fonts":["Zru\u0161i\u0165 pr\u00edstup ku Google Fonts"],"Current page":["Aktu\u00e1lna str\u00e1nka"],"No fonts found to install.":["Nena\u0161li sa \u017eiadne p\u00edsma na in\u0161tal\u00e1ciu."],"Uploaded fonts appear in your library and can be used in your theme. Supported formats: .ttf, .otf, .woff, and .woff2.":["Nahran\u00e9 typy p\u00edsma sa zobrazia vo va\u0161ej kni\u017enici a mo\u017eno ich pou\u017ei\u0165 vo va\u0161ej t\u00e9me. Podporovan\u00e9 form\u00e1ty: .ttf, .otf, .woff, and .woff2."],"No fonts installed.":["Nie s\u00fa nain\u0161talovan\u00e9 \u017eiadne typy p\u00edsma."],"There was an error installing fonts.":["Pri in\u0161tal\u00e1cii typov p\u00edsma do\u0161lo k chybe."],"Font library\u0004Library":["Kni\u017enica"],"Uppercase letter A\u0004A":["A"],"Lowercase letter A\u0004a":["a"],"Font family updated successfully.":["Rodina p\u00edsma bola \u00faspe\u0161ne aktualizovan\u00e1."],"font source\u0004Theme":["Z t\u00e9my"],"font source\u0004Custom":["Vlastn\u00fd"],"There was an error updating the font family. %s":["Pri aktualiz\u00e1cii rodiny p\u00edsma do\u0161lo k chybe. %s"],"variation label\u0004%1$s (%2$s)":["%1$s (%2$s)"],"noun\u0004Upload":["Nahra\u0165"],"paging\u0004<div>Page<\/div>%1$s<div>of %2$d<\/div>":["<div>Strana<\/div>%1$s<div>z %2$d<\/div>"],"Font family to uninstall is not defined.":["Nie je definovan\u00e1 rodina p\u00edsma na odin\u0161talovanie."],"Update":["Aktualizova\u0165"],"Next page":["Nasleduj\u00faca strana"],"Previous page":["Predch\u00e1dzaj\u00faca strana"],"Sorry, you are not allowed to upload this file type.":["Nem\u00e1te opr\u00e1vnenie nahra\u0165 s\u00fabor tohto typu."],"Cancel":["Zru\u0161i\u0165"],"Search":["H\u013ea